      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MOROSINI (9) gets the winkers on for the first time today after a solid performance out to the mile last start at Moruya. Not beaten far there and Boudvillain hopping on board is a bonus. She can get the job done this time around. RAPID REIGNS (7) gets the blinkers on for the first time today and stepping up to the mile for the first time looks a good move. He's still a lightly raced colt, so there's plenty of room to improve and he can make an impression. MR TUCCI (6) was no match for the winner here last start but getting out to the mile now is a big tick for his chances. Maps well for Sherry and he can improve quickly out to this distance. PRESUMPTUOUS GAL (5) was solid back to the mile last time out and can feature in the finish once more. NUTBUSH DANCER (4) can improve stepping out in trip again today.",
